Package: aic8800d80-recovery-dkms
Version: 1.0.0-2
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 3.0), build-essential, kmod, usb-modeswitch, eject
Conflicts: aic8800-dkms, aic8800d80-dkms
Maintainer: AIC8800D80 Recovery contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/pedro-separe/aic8800d80
Description: Recovery-focused DKMS driver for AIC8800D80 USB Wi-Fi adapters
 Builds the aic8800_fdrv and aic_load_fw modules for the installed kernel.
 Includes AIC8800 firmware, udev rules and usb_modeswitch configuration.
 Modules are installed on disk but are not loaded automatically by this package.
